@enter nithish left 0.4
@shot on nithish
NARRATOR: Nithish is brought into the station, sweating. His eyes move from one officer to the next.
  ta: Nithish vervaiyoda station-kulla kondu varappadraan. Kann ovvoru officer mela-yum thaavudhu.
@shot close nithish
NITHISH (thinking): How did this happen?! I used to cross the street to avoid a police station. And now I'm inside one. Why did I run? If I hadn't listened to Dhanasree, they wouldn't have arrested me... Why am I such an idiot!
  ta: Yepdi idhu nadandhuchu?! Police station pakkam pona kuda na odhingi-dhaan povan. Aana… ippo naaney ulla maatikiten. Na yen odunen… Dhanasree sonnadha kekama irundhurundha, oru-vela yenna arrest panniruka-matanga… Yen dhaan na ivalo muttal-ah irukan!
@shot memory
NARRATOR: Janani's voice, from the day of the fest: "You took what they said seriously. That shows your good character."
  ta: Fest anniku Janani kural: "Nee avunga sonnadha madhichi irundadhu unnoda nalla character-ah kaatudhu."
@shot present
@shot two nithish ramanan
RAMANAN: Thambi, give me everything in your pockets. Phone, watch, all of it.
  ta: Thambi, un packet-la irukura yellathaiyum kudu. Phone, watch yellathaiyum.
RAMANAN: This stays with us until you leave. If you want to call anyone, ask me first. You can ask for a lawyer. In your situation it might help.
  ta: Idhu yenga kitta irukum, nee pora varaikum. Yar-koodayavadhu phone pesanum-na yen kitta modhala kekanum. Nee lawyer yaradhu venum-na request pannalam. Indha nelamai-la unakku konjo udhavi-ah irukum.
@shot close nithish
NITHISH (thinking): A lawyer... Is it that bad? Are they going to put me in jail?
  ta: Lawyer-ah, andha alavukku-ah yen nelama mosama iruku. Yenna jail-la potruvangala appo?

@scene gen:house_night
@cast dhanasree@0.36> ragul@0.6<
@prop shelf@0.1^ door@0.9^
@caption Dhanasree's house, Mogappair
  ta: Dhanasree veedu, Mogappair
@music campus_night
@shot pan right
NARRATOR: Dhanasree's house. It's big, and very quiet. She locks the front door behind them; the click echoes.
  ta: Dhanasree veedu. Periya veedu, romba amaidhi. Main door-a poottura; "click" saththam edhirolikkudhu.
@shot auto
DHANASREE: It's just me and my father here. He doesn't get home till about nine.
  ta: Yen veetla naanum yen appa mattum-dha irukom. Avarum duty mudichu varadhu-ku oru 9 o'clock aidum.
RAGUL (scared): What if he comes?
  ta: Avaru vandhuta yenna panradhu?
DHANASREE: This is my mother's room. Nobody goes in here, not even my father. You sleep here. The hostel will be full of police; you'd be caught. And they'd never think you're here. Keep your phone off.
  ta: Idhu yen amma-oda room. Yaru vandhalum indha room-kulla poga maatanga, yen appa kooda. Nee inga thoongiko. Hostel-la confirm police irupaanga. Nee anga pona kandippa maatikuva. Police ku nee inga-dhaan irpan-nu doubt varadhu. Phone mattum switch-off laye irukatum.
@shot on ragul
RAGUL (scared): What about Nithish? What will the police do to him? What if he gives you up? Then I'll be caught too. If my family hears... my relatives... our whole family's name— But I didn't do anything, I don't know anything... Why does this have to happen to me? What if they check the cameras tomorrow and find—
  ta: Nithish nenacha-dhaan yenaku konjo bayam-ah iruku. Police yenna pannuvanga avana? Oruvela avan unna maati-vittutana, naanum matikuvan-la. Veetuku yellam sonna… Yenga kudumba maanamey naaridum… aana… na yedhum pannala, yenaku yedhuvum theriyadhu… yenakku yen ipdi yellam nadakkanum. Nalaikey camera yellam check panni—
@shot close dhanasree
DHANASREE (angry): Can you shut your mouth for a second?! All you know how to do is be scared! Every single time you get scared and overthink, and do you know how many problems that's caused?!
  ta: Vaaya konjo moodriya! Bayandhu savaradhu thavara vera yedhumey unakku theriyadhu-la…! Yella thadavaiyum nee bayandhu-bayandhu, yosichu-yosichu yethana prechana airuku theriyuma huh?
@shot push dhanasree
DHANASREE (angry): Big talk about other worlds and saving girls, and nothing real behind it! If you hadn't been scared, do you know how much we could have stopped... fucking coward.
  ta: Summa vera ulagathuku ponum, ponna kaapathanum-nu vaai mattum-dhaan nejathula onnum illa! Nee mattum bayapadama irundhirundha-na yevlo visaya-tha thaduthurkalam-nu theriyumaa… fucking coward.
@shot close ragul
NARRATOR: A tear runs down Ragul's face, though his face doesn't look sad.
  ta: Ragul kannathula oru kanneer odudhu, aana mugathula sogam theriyala.
@shot two ragul dhanasree
RAGUL: So you've noticed me in class?
  ta: Appo class-la yenna notice pannirukiya?
DHANASREE: No. But I know.
  ta: Illa, aana theriyum.
@shot close ragul
RAGUL (thinking): No. This isn't my fault. I didn't make myself a coward. It's God's fault. If I told her that, she'd call me an idiot...
  ta: Illa, idhuku na karanam illa. Yenna bayandhangoli-ah create pannadhuku, na yenna panna mudiyum. Idhu kadavul-oda thappu. Idhellam iva-kitta sonna, yenna muttal-nu solluva…
@shot auto
DHANASREE: Okay. I said that in anger, without thinking. Sorry.
  ta: Sari, yedho theriyama kovathula solliten, sorry.
RAGUL: No, it's fine. You only said the truth.
  ta: Illa paravala, unmaiya-dhan solliruka.
DHANASREE (quiet): I'm worried about Nithish too. But he won't say anything. I know him.
  ta: Yenakkum Nithish pathi nenacha kavalaiya-dhan iruku. But Nithish yedhuvum solla-maatan, yenaku nalla theriyum.
RAGUL: Dhanasree... Nithish didn't do anything, right? They'll let him go?
  ta: Hey Dhanasree, Nithish yedhuvum pannala-la? Nithish-ah appo release panniruvanga dhana?
DHANASREE: No. ...Hmm.
  ta: Illa. …Hmm.
@pose ragul sit
@pose dhanasree sit
@shot two ragul dhanasree
NARRATOR: They sit on the floor eating toasted bread.
  ta: Rendu perum tharaila ukkandhu toast bread saapduraanga.
RAGUL: Where's your mother gone?
  ta: Aama, un amma yenga poirukanga?
@shot orbit dhanasree
@shot dutch
NARRATOR: Dhanasree laughs: the same strange laugh.
  ta: Dhanasree sirikkura: adhe vinoadhamaana sirippu.
@shot level
@shot close dhanasree
DHANASREE: My mother's dead.
  ta: Yen amma yerandhutanga.
RAGUL: Oh...
  ta: Oh…
@shot on ragul
RAGUL: So, er... how's life? Kids doing well?
  ta: Seri, vaalkaa yepdi pogudhu? Kolandha kutti yellam sowkiyama?
@shot two ragul dhanasree
DHANASREE: Life? Going like shit.
  ta: Vaalkaiya, mayiru maari pogudhu.
RAGUL: Hey, you talk like that too?
  ta: Yei, nee ipdi yellam kooda pesuviya?
DHANASREE: Why, can't I?
  ta: Yen pesa koodadha yenna?
@pose dhanasree idle
DHANASREE: Eat. I'm going for a bath. Wash your hands in the kitchen.
  ta: Seri nee saputtu iru, na poi kulichitu varan. Kitchen-la poi kai kaluviko.
