NITHISH (thinking): He thinks I know something about these deaths. But I don't. Dhanasree... no. I can't drag her into this. What happens to her life? If her father finds out...
  ta: Yenakku indha saavu pathi yedachu theriyum-nu nenaikuraru. Aana illa. Dhanasree… Illa, avala naan idhukulla kondu vara kudadhu. Ava vaazhkai yenna aguradhu… avunga appa-vuku therinja avlodhan.
