@label v07_dance
@shot close player
NARRATOR: The memory pulls him in: her smile, the music moving through her. He isn't sure if it was the dance, or just her. His lips curl into a small smile.
  ta: Andha nyabagam avana izhukudhu: aval sirippu, aval udambula odura isai. Adhu dance-ah, illa aval-ah, theriyala. Avan udhattula oru chinna sirippu.
@shot orbit player
NARRATOR: Before he knows it, he's dancing. Badly, but with everything he has.
  ta: Theriyaamaiye aada aarambichuttaan. Mosama, aana muzhu manasoda.
@shot auto
DHANASREE (happy): Why'd you stop? You're good.
  ta: Yen nippatita? Nalla dhaan-a aadura.
RAGUL: N-no, that's enough.
  ta: illa podhum.
NARRATOR: He snatches the remote and flips to a news channel. His eyes are still on her.
  ta: Remote-a pudungi news channel-ku maathuraan. Kann innum aval mela dhaan.
@music none
NEWS: In Tamil Nadu, over the last few days, mysterious deaths...
  ta: Tamil Nadu-la kadandha sila naatkalaaga marmamaana...
@shot slow
@shot close player
NARRATOR: Her smile fades. Her eyes go to the clock on the wall. 8:15 PM. Her fists clench.
  ta: Aval sirippu marayudhu. Suvar-la irukura gadigaaram-a paakura. Raathiri 8:15. Kai irukudhu.
@shot normal
@shot push player
DHANASREE (thinking): Three more days... No. Only sixty-nine hours left...
  ta: Innum moonu naal… Illa. 69 hours dhaan iruku…
RAGUL (worried): Dhanasree, what's happening? Do you know something about this?
  ta: Dhanasree yenna nadakudhu? Unakku idha pathi yedachu theriyuma?
DHANASREE: To be honest... I don't know exactly.
  ta: Unmaiya sollanum-na… yennaku correct-ah therla.
