@shot shake
@shot push nithish
NARRATOR: The cell door bangs shut. The sound echoes through Nithish's head.
  ta: Cell kadhavu "dhadaal"-nu moodudhu. Andha saththam Nithish thalaikulla edhirolikkudhu.
NITHISH (thinking): What now? Everything's slipping out of my hands. If there's no way out of this... that's it? My life ends here?
  ta: Ippo yenna panradhu? Yellamey yen kai meeri pogudhu… Oruvela idhula irundhu thappika valiye illana yenna pandradhu? Appo… avlodhana, yennoda vaazhka ingaye mudinjirucha…
NITHISH (thinking): No... I didn't do anything wrong. Why should I go to jail? Nothing will happen to me. God is there. He knows I did nothing.
  ta: Illa… Na yendha thappum pannala, na yen jail-ku ponum. Yenaku onnum aavadhu. Kadavul irukaru. Avaruku theriyum na thappu pannala-nu.
@shot close nithish
NITHISH (sad): Or maybe... this is just how my life was meant to end.
  ta: Oruvela… yen vaazhka ipdi-dhaan mudiyanum-nu iruku pola…
